sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as Employer wallet
    participant BK as Employer's bank
    participant H as DisbursementHub
    participant W as Worker wallets

    Note over E: Payout list stays off chain,<br/>its Merkle root goes on chain
    E->>H: tBDT for the whole batch + (reference, Merkle root, count, purpose)
    BK->>H: approve(batch)
    loop in chunks
        BK->>H: execute(batch, payouts with Merkle proofs)
        H->>H: proof valid, payout not yet processed
        H->>W: wage paid
        Note over H,W: A frozen or closed wallet is recorded as failed,<br/>the other payouts go through
    end
    BK->>H: close(batch)
    H->>E: undelivered amount returned
